    {
      "position": 2,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "The above example should really be に応えて. 応 such as 回答 involves answering questions whereas 応 such as 応じる or 対応 means to respond to, to deal with. As proof, comparing google results for ニーズに答えて and ニーズに応えて reveils 2,000 vs 27,000 results.",
      "html": "The above example should really be に応えて. 応 such as 回答 involves answering questions whereas 応 such as 応じる or 対応 means to respond to, to deal with. As proof, comparing google results for ニーズに答えて and ニーズに応えて reveils 2,000 vs 27,000 results.",
      "credits_raw": "kimchi314",
      "content_sha256": "b97fc39481c885921a2bf384b8fbfaa27df237273a1c10079eba2805721f46e7",
